<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-3/8 (FIM 266.60).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-3/8 (FIM 266.60).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $0-1/8 at $57-3/8 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 266.60 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Monday, Nokia A closed up 0.90 markka at 266.80.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) were untraded on Wall Street on Monday. In Helsinki, Valmet rose 0.10 markka to close at 81.00 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed up $0-1/2 at $21-1/4 in New York on Monday. The price corresponds to about 98.70 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma fell 1.00 to end at 97.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
